cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the accompanying arXiv paper in preferred-citation when using Grid-Bench."
type: software
version: 0.6.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/grid-bench/Grid-Bench"
title: "Grid-Bench"
abstract: >-
  Grid-Bench evaluates complete spatial state prediction from an initial grid,
  explicit rules, and an event history. Eight operation families cover two-,
  three-, and four-dimensional grids, with executable reference states and
  cell-level error analysis.
